{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/15/5648872/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はかずみん誘って\nみたままつり行ってきたよ〜(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夏 初お祭り＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お祭りっていいね！\n雰囲気が好きなんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/15/5648872/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋台いいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅうり食べて\nじゃがバター食べて\nホットク食べたよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おなかいっぱいだー(´｀*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホットクってのは韓国の料理らしいよ！\nあんこ入ってるの食べたんだけど\nあったかくてもちもちしてて\nおいしかった(*´Д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n韓国と言えば(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...また次の記事に書こう(・ω・)焦らし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママは埼玉から来てたの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n埼玉から来てたとゆーか\n大阪の実家から来てた！\nそしてまだ帰ってこないよ〜(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもPASMOにどれくらい入ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n日によるけど\n1000円くらいかなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪のオヌヌメスポットは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nうーん、ビリケンさん？w\n場所ってよりは\nお好み焼きとかたこ焼きとか串カツとか\n食べたほうがいいと思うよ(*・ω・)ノ\n551、マダムシンコ、点天、堂島ロールなどなど〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事のタイトル\nぐるカーじゃなくて\nおいシャンだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/15/5648872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\nレポ粗すぎてちょっといろいろぬけた(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/15/5648872/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木どこだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急いで帰って\nごはん食べて\nお風呂入って\nゆっくりしてから見ようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/15/5648872/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}